The dependency graph, resolved package URLs and integrity hashes are recorded
in package-lock.json. Each dependency retains its own copyright and license.
The generated bundle preserves upstream legal comments; DEPENDENCIES.md lists
the packages and licenses shipped in the bundle.

Focus Browser's adapter is maintained in src/focus_ghostery_adblocker.js. The
FocusBlock interface includes a technical attribution footer identifying
Ghostery 2.18.1. The Ghostery extension product, user interface and branding
assets are not included.
